Use this section after FOSSBilling is installed. It covers the core admin settings you are most likely to review before opening the system to clients.

Start with [Configuration](/admin-guide/config/) and [Company Information](/admin-guide/company/), then review emails, localization, invoices, product types, and server manager integrations.

